<title>DUBAI: SOCCER-WORLD CUP ASIAN ZONE GROUP TWO RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WORLD CUP ASIAN ZONE GROUP TWO RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of World Cup Asian zone</p>
<p>group two qualifying matches played in Tehran on Monday:</p>
<p>Syria 12 Maldives 0 (Halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: A.Arif 23, 50, 66, Louay Taleb 62, Said Zaidan 66,</p>
<p>88, 90, Ali Shaikh 57, Ammar Rihawiy 69, Redwan Abri 82, 90,</p>
<p>Tallal Khaled 86</p>
<p>Iran 3 Kyrgyzstan 1 (1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Iran - Khodadad Azizi 3, 79, Karim Baqeri 52</p>
<p>Kyrgyzstan - Sergei Rostov 19</p>
<p>    Standings	 P   W   D   L   F   A   Pts</p>
<p> Iran		   4   4   0   0  28   1    12</p>
<p> Syria		  3   2   0   1  24   1     6</p>
<p> Kyrgyzstan	   3   1   0   2   4  10     3</p>
<p> Maldives	     4   0   0   4   0  44     0</p>
<p>Remaining matches (in Tehran): June 11 - Iran v Maldives,</p>
<p>Kyrgyzstan v Syria, June 13 - Iran v Syria, Maldives v</p>
<p>Kyrgyzstan, TBA Syria v Kyrgyzstan.</p>
</text>
